[gd_scene load_steps=6 format=3 uid="uid://unitcanvasfileovertexfile"]

; One variable: where a CanvasTexture and its diffuse map are saved. Both sprites draw the same
; red-to-blue GradientTexture2D through a CanvasTexture. The left one's CanvasTexture and gradient
; are sub-resources of the scene. The right one's is `unit-texture-file-canvas.tres`, whose
; diffuse map is `unit-texture-file-gradient.tres`, so the two draw the same ramp. No other golden
; saves a CanvasTexture, or a texture resource as its diffuse map, in a file.

